#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/pst/ps/epdfview.xml:26
#, xml-text
msgid "Introduction to ePDFView-gtk3"
msgstr "Introdução ao ePDFView-gtk3"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/pst/ps/epdfview.xml:29
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<application>ePDFView-gtk3</application> is a fork of the old "
"<application>ePDFView</application> program. Although the github repository "
"<ulink url=\"https://github.com/Flow-It/epdfview_old.git\"/> names it as "
"'old', it is the gtk3 fork. It is a lightweight replacement for "
"<application>Evince</application> as it does not rely upon "
"<application>GNOME</application> libraries and is more capable than "
"<application>MuPDF</application>."
msgstr ""
"<application>ePDFView-gtk3</application> é uma bifurcação do antigo programa "
"<application>ePDFView</application>. Embora o repositório github <ulink url="
"\"https://github.com/Flow-It/epdfview_old.git\"/> o nomeie como 'antigo', é "
"a bifurcação gtk3. É um substituto leve para o <application>Evince</"
"application>, pois não depende das bibliotecas do <application>GNOME</"
"application> e é mais capaz que o <application>MuPDF</application>."

