msgstr "Recomendadas"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/pst/ps/epdfview.xml:84
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<xref linkend=\"cups\"/> (to access print queues), <xref linkend=\"desktop-"
"file-utils\"/>, and <xref linkend=\"hicolor-icon-theme\"/> (both for the "
"icons this installs)"
msgstr ""
"<xref linkend=\"cups\"/> (para acessar filas de impressão), <xref linkend"
"=\"desktop-file-utils\"/> e <xref linkend=\"hicolor-icon-theme\"/> (ambos "
"para os ícones que isso instala)"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><bridgehead>
#: blfs-en/pst/ps/epdfview.xml:89
#, xml-text
msgid "Optional"
msgstr "Opcionais"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/pst/ps/epdfview.xml:91
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"The home page of the project's repository mentions that there are optional "
"dependencies, which are enabled by switches. These are for building the "
"documentation and running the test suite, <xref linkend=\"doxygen\"/> and "
"<ulink url='https://freedesktop.org/wiki/Software/cppunit/'>Cppunit</ulink>."
"  Note that <application>doxygen</application> only installs a skeletal page"
" about itself, which contains no package documentation, and the test code "
"does not compile with recent versions of C++."
msgstr ""
"A página inicial do repositório do projeto menciona que existem dependências "
"opcionais, que são habilitadas por chaves. Elas são para construir a "
"documentação e executar a suíte de teste, <xref linkend=\"doxygen\"/> e "
"<ulink url='https://freedesktop.org/wiki/Software/cppunit/'>Cppunit</ulink>. "
"Observe que <application>doxygen</application> instala somente uma página "
"esquelética acerca dele mesmo, que não contém documentação de pacote, e o "
"código de teste não compila com versões recentes de C++."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/pst/ps/epdfview.xml:103
#, xml-text
msgid "Installation of ePDFView-gtk3"
msgstr "Instalação do ePDFView-gtk3"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/pst/ps/epdfview.xml:106
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Install <application>ePDFView-gtk3</application> by running the following "
"commands:"
msgstr ""
"Instale o <application>ePDFView-gtk3</application> executando os seguintes "
"comandos:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/pst/ps/epdfview.xml:110
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>mkdir build &amp;&amp;\n"
"cd    build &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"meson setup --prefix=/usr          \\\n"
"            --buildtype=release    \\\n"
"            -Denable-printing=true \\\n"
"            ..                     &amp;&amp;\n"
"ninja</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>mkdir build &amp;&amp;\n"
"cd    build &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"meson setup --prefix=/usr          \\\n"
"            --buildtype=release    \\\n"
"            -Denable-printing=true \\\n"
"            ..                     &amp;&amp;\n"
"ninja</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/pst/ps/epdfview.xml:120
#, xml-text
msgid "This package does not come with a buildable test suite."
msgstr "Esse pacote não vem com uma suíte construível de teste."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/pst/ps/epdfview.xml:124
#, xml-text
msgid "Now, as the <systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem> user:"
msgstr ""
"Agora, como o(a) usuário(a) <systemitem "
"class=\"username\">root</systemitem>:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/pst/ps/epdfview.xml:127
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid "<userinput>ninja install</userinput>"
msgstr "<userinput>ninja install</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/pst/ps/epdfview.xml:135
#, xml-text
msgid "Command Explanations"
msgstr "Explicações do Comando"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/pst/ps/epdfview.xml:137
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<command>-Denable-printing=true</command>: builds the code to link to the "
"<application>cups</application> print queue(s). Omit this if you have not "
"installed <application>cups</application>."
msgstr ""
"<command>-Denable-printing=true</command>: constrói o código para vincular "
"com a(s) fila(s) de impressão do <application>cups</application>. Omita isso "
"se você não tiver instalado o <application>cups</application>."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/pst/ps/epdfview.xml:144
#, xml-text
msgid "Configuring ePDFView-gtk3"
msgstr "Configurando ePDFView-gtk3"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/pst/ps/epdfview.xml:147
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"ePDFView-gtk3 has several keyboard hotkeys for optional features. Most of "
"them are 'off' by default, including the toolbar, and if it has been closed "
"with the menu disabled, the program can start with all options not being "
"visible until the relevant function keys are pressed."
msgstr ""
"ePDFView-gtk3 tem várias teclas de atalho de teclado para recursos "
"opcionais. A maioria delas está 'desligada' por padrão, incluindo a barra de "
"ferramentas, e se ela tiver sido fechada com o menu desabilitado, o programa "
"pode iniciar com todas as opções não estando visíveis até que as teclas "
"relevantes de função sejam pressionadas."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para><itemizedlist><listitem><para>
#: blfs-en/pst/ps/epdfview.xml:153
#, xml-text
msgid "[F6] - toggle toolbar"
msgstr "[F6] - alternar barra de ferramentas"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para><itemizedlist><listitem><para>
#: blfs-en/pst/ps/epdfview.xml:156
#, xml-text
msgid "[F7] - toggle menu"
msgstr "[F7] - alternar menu"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para><itemizedlist><listitem><para>
#: blfs-en/pst/ps/epdfview.xml:159
#, xml-text
msgid "[F8] - toggle invert-colors"
msgstr "[F8] - alternar cores invertidas"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para><itemizedlist><listitem><para>
#: blfs-en/pst/ps/epdfview.xml:162
#, xml-text
msgid "[F9] - toggle show-index"
msgstr "[F9] - alternar mostrar índice"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para><itemizedlist><listitem><para>
#: blfs-en/pst/ps/epdfview.xml:165
#, xml-text
msgid "[F11] - toggle fullscreen"
msgstr "[F11] - alternar para tela cheia"

